 "description": "Designed to go further, stay longer, and bring people together in remarkable comfort, the Flyer 30 introduces a new expression of the Flyer spirit. Elegant, versatile, and confidently capable, it reimagines the day boat through refined architecture, thoughtful protection, and seamless social design.",
