   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "The Flyer 30 introduces a refined design language for the range, one defined by continuity, lightness, and contemporary elegance.\nFrom hull to hardtop, every line has been carefully considered to create a seamless architectural flow. The silhouette feels strong yet calm, striking yet never excessive. Open sightlines, balanced proportions, and a floating roof effect give the boat a distinctive presence on the water while reinforcing the sense of connection to the surrounding horizon.\nThis is a design that does not seek attention through excess. It earns it through harmony.",
