   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The Flyer 30 has been conceived around a simple idea: your time on the water should feel natural, fluid, and shared.\nIts single-level asymmetrical deck creates seamless circulation across the boat, making movement more intuitive and opening each living space to the next. The result is a layout that feels lighter, more social, and more welcoming from every angle.\nEvery zone has been designed to reduce friction and support the way people truly live on board today, moving, gathering, relaxing, and enjoying the moment together.",
