  {
   "title": "Deck layout",
   "bullets": [
    "Single-level asymmetric deck for seamless, intuitive circulation from bow to stern",
    "Wrap-around bow lounge with integrated cupholders, dry storage, USB-A/USB-C charging, and cooler storage",
    "Full-height curved windshield with side windows and wiper for greater protection and visibility",
    "Three-seat helm station with adjustable flip-up bolsters, armrests, tilt steering, wireless phone charging, and up to two ultra-wide Garmin displays",
    "Integrated wet bar with Corian countertop, sink, storage, trash bin, and stainless-steel cupholders",
    "Flexible cockpit seating with flip-back sunpad / convertible backrests, adapting easily between lounging, dining, and entertaining",
    "Insulated integrated cooler tub beneath the cockpit seating",
    "Drawer refrigerator under helm seat (optional)",
    "Deep-reach, extra-wide boarding ladder for easy access to the water",
    "Through-hull anchor roller / windlass option with stainless-steel anchor, rope, and chain",
    "Aft lazarette storage plus additional storage throughout the deck",
    "Full-beam transom passage for practical, secure movement on board"
   ],
   "text": "- Single-level asymmetric deck for seamless, intuitive circulation from bow to stern\n- Wrap-around bow lounge with integrated cupholders, dry storage, USB-A/USB-C charging, and cooler storage\n- Full-height curved windshield with side windows and wiper for greater protection and visibility\n- Three-seat helm station with adjustable flip-up bolsters, armrests, tilt steering, wireless phone charging, and up to two ultra-wide Garmin displays\n- Integrated wet bar with Corian countertop, sink, storage, trash bin, and stainless-steel cupholders\n- Flexible cockpit seating with flip-back sunpad / convertible backrests, adapting easily between lounging, dining, and entertaining\n- Insulated integrated cooler tub beneath the cockpit seating\n- Drawer refrigerator under helm seat (optional)\n- Deep-reach, extra-wide boarding ladder for easy access to the water\n- Through-hull anchor roller / windlass option with stainless-steel anchor, rope, and chain\n- Aft lazarette storage plus additional storage throughout the deck\n- Full-beam transom passage for practical, secure movement on board",
